        "meta_descr": "NewEra Protect is a dietary supplement designed to support women who want to maintain healthy bladder function and everyday urinary wellness. It promotes overall comfort with a carefully selected blend of natural ingredients.\n\nThis formulation is intended to help encourage a sense of emotional balance and confidence, allowing you to focus on your wellness journey and approach each day with poise and self-assurance.",
